===persian===

کبوتر
در قفس...
آنقدر خواند...
تا سایه‌اش را
از قفس بیرون راند،
سایه، نوری بر کبوتر تاباند...
کبوتر...
وردِ آزادی را از بر کرد...
سایهٔ قفس بر کبوتر افتاد...
پرهایش را زیباتر کرد...
کبوتر ماند...
کبوتر خواند...
کبوترها را لرزاند.
۱۳۷۳

===machine===

The dove
in the cage...
sang so long...
that it drove its own shadow
out through the bars,
and the shadow shone a light back on the dove...
The dove...
learned the spell of freedom by heart...
The shadow of the cage fell across the dove...
and made its feathers lovelier...
The dove stayed...
The dove sang...
and set all the doves trembling.
1373

===lantern===

The dove in the cage
sang so long
that it drove its own shadow
out through the bars,
and the shadow shone a light back on the dove.
The dove
learned the spell of freedom by heart.
The shadow of the cage fell across the dove
and made its feathers lovelier.
The dove stayed.
The dove sang.
And it set all the doves trembling.

1373

===translation===

===footnotes===

The bird does not escape. It sends its shadow out, is given back light, and stays where it
is — and the staying is what shakes the other birds.
